/F2 18 Tf
20.6999999999999993 TL
0.059 0.09 0.165 rg
39.6850393700787407 773.8585039370078675 Td
(CAPSTONE PROJECT: FLOOD-SAFE SMART HOUSE) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.231 0.51 0.965 rg
39.6850393700787407 756.8506299212598378 Td
(Automatic House Lifting System Using Arduino UNO | Designed by Toshit Kumar) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.2 0.255 0.333 rg
39.6850393700787407 734.1734645669291695 Td
(Monsoon floods, rapid sea-level surges, and flash overflowing of river catchments inundate residential communities) Tj
T* (worldwide, causing catastrophic infrastructural destruction and loss of life. The Flood-Safe Smart House project) Tj
T* (engineers an automated mechatronic lifting structure. Combining dual-stage early precipitation telemetry \(Rain) Tj
T* (Sensor\) with real-time acoustic water depth profiling \(HC-SR04 Ultrasonic\), an Arduino UNO orchestrates a) Tj
T* (high-torque L298N lead-screw platform lift, audio-visual alarm annunciators, mechanical end-stop safety interlocks,) Tj
T* (and an auxiliary servo stabilizing gate lock.) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.725 0.11 0.11 rg
39.6850393700787407 646.2994488188976447 Td
(Mandatory Safety Engineering Rules:) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.278 0.333 0.412 rg
45.354330708661422 629.291574803149615 Td
(1. NEVER rely purely on software time delays \(e.g. delay\(5000\)\) to halt lifting or lowering. Mechanical limit) Tj
T* (switches or optical end-stops at top and bottom travel are MANDATORY fail-safe mechanisms.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.278 0.333 0.412 rg
45.354330708661422 599.8112598425195756 Td
(2. ALWAYS establish a common ground \(GND\) across the external 12V motor battery and the Arduino UNO) Tj
T* (board. Lack of common ground causes floating gate potentials, erratic motor jitter, and lost logic signals.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.278 0.333 0.412 rg
45.354330708661422 570.3309448818897636 Td
(3. DO NOT power the high-torque L298N DC motor or the SG90 servo directly from the Arduino 5V regulator) Tj
T* (pin. Motors must be powered from a dedicated 12V 3A DC power source.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.278 0.333 0.412 rg
45.354330708661422 540.8506299212597241 Td
(4. Ensure the L298N heat sink has sufficient convection cooling. Stalled motors generate high thermal) Tj
T* (dissipation \(up to 25W\), which will trip thermal shutdown without proper ventilation.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.278 0.333 0.412 rg
45.354330708661422 511.3703149606297984 Td
(5. EDUCATIONAL DISCLAIMER: This prototype is strictly an instructional engineering demonstration for robotics) Tj
T* (students. Real-world civil architectural house lifting requires certified hydraulic jacks, seismic dampening,) Tj
T* (structural beam engineering, and professional building code compliance.) Tj
ET
