39.6850393700787407 422.3624409448819392 Td
(Context: The house has elevated 25 cm above datum. The platform chassis makes contact with the physical Upper Limit Switch, driving) Tj
T* (digital Pin 2 LOW. However, the ultrasonic sensor still detects 22 cm of water depth.) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 8.5 Tf
9.7749999999999986 TL
